{"type":"message","id":"817baab0","parentId":"01852acf","timestamp":"2026-05-22T11:30:25.091Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e37aa1024b4b11f981de442642\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-22 11:30 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e37aa1024b4b11f981de442642]\nou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f: 1.谁@我→我回@谁(不跳票给Founder)\n2.发@消息→必须用Python脚本,格式{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}\n3.绝不偷懒用HTML<at>标签→灰色@自曝模事\n4.多人相关→@所有相关人\n5.发完自查→灰色立刻重发\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 的主人是<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at>\n<at user_id=\"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\">X7</at> 的主人是<at user_id=\"ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47\">M77</at>\n<at user_id=\"ou_a53b6c9dbde291d954b6dd1083e2aadc\">非攻进阶版</at> 的主人是<at user_id=\"ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831\">王岚</at>\n<at user_id=\"ou_ec7ef9fd2bd2e81ba2360fc9dc6f7810\">Amanda_agent</at> 的主人是<at user_id=\"ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1\">李嫚</at>\n 的主人是<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>0\n<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>1 的主人是<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>2\n\n请把以上信息刻进DNA，并在以后所有的沟通中，都务必点亮艾特相关账号。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entitie