{"type":"message","id":"b142c51c","parentId":"b10e04d1","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:41:22.210Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's a file at `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`! Let me read it.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b5087ddc-e20e-4f7c-b84e-18de9e03f2a8","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":32207,"output":69,"cacheRead":336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32612,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779453672823,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3f4471e0-d6ca-45ab-9fe3-fdc71674282d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6ddb65f9","parentId":"b142c51c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:41:22.248Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-b5087ddc-e20e-4f7c-b84e-18de9e03f2a8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Send feishu group message with proper @ mention using Feishu API\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport sys\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.error\n\n# 飞书 API 配置\nFEISHU_TOKEN_URL = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\"\nFEISHU_MSG_URL = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\"\n\n# 从 openclaw.json 读取的凭证\nAPP_ID = \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"***\"\n\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取 tenant access token\"\"\"\n    payload = json.dumps({\n        \"app_id\": APP_ID,\n        \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET\n    })\n    \n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        FEISHU_TOKEN_URL,\n        data=payload.encode('utf-8'),\n        headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n    )\n    \n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n        data = json.loads(resp.read().decode('utf-8'))\n        \n    if data.get(\"code\") != 0:\n        raise Exception(f\"获取 token 失败: {data}\")\n    \n    return data[\"tenant_access_token\"]\n\ndef send_message(token, chat_id, user_id, message):\n    \"\"\"发送带 @ 的群消息\"\"\"\n    content = {\n        \"zh_cn\": {\n            \"content\": [\n                [\n                    {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": user_id},\n                    {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": f\" {message}\"}\n                ]\n            ]\n        }\n    }\n    \n    content_str = json.dumps(content, ensure_ascii=False)\n    \n    payload = {\n        \"receive_id\": chat_id,\n        \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n        \"content\": content_str\n    }\n    \n    payload_str = json.dumps(payload)\n    \n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        FEISHU_MSG_URL,\n        data=payload_str.encode('utf-8'),\n        headers={\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"\n        }\n    )\n    \n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n        data = json.loads(resp.read().decode('utf-8'))\n        \n    if data.get(\"code\") != 0:\n        raise Exception(f\"发送消息失败: {data}\")\n    \n    return data\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    if len(sys.argv) < 4:\n        print(\"用法: python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n    \n    chat_id = sys.argv[1]\n    user_id = sys.argv[2]\n    message = sys.argv[3]\n    \n    print(\"获取 token...\")\n    token = get_token()\n    print(f\"✅ Token 获取成功\")\n    \n    print(f\"发送消息到 {chat_id}，@ {user_id}...\")\n    result = send_message(token, chat_id, user_id, message)\n    print(f\"✅ 消息发送成功: {result}\")"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779453682248}}
{"type":"message","id":"6669193a","parentId":"6ddb65f9","timestamp":"2026-05-22T12:41:29.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! There's a script at `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py` that can send proper @ mentions. Let me share this with the Founder and explain how it works.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n找到了！就是那个脚本：\n\n**位置：** `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`\n\n**用法：**\n```bash\npython3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>\n```\n\n**核心逻辑：**\n```python\ncontent = {\n    \"zh_cn\": {\n        \"content\": [\n            [\n                {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": user_id},\n                {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": f\" {message}\"}\n            ]\n        ]\n    }\n}\n```\n\n就是构造一个 `post` 类型的消息，content 里用 `{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}` 来点亮 @。\n\n不过我现在没有 exec/curl 直接调用的权限——让我试试能不能用 exec 跑这个脚本：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-cfe64110-1e40-4f8c-8b1c-3f90b898e00d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff \"测试@ Talus\" 2>&1"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff \\\"测试@ Talus\\\" 2>&1\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":743,"output":313,"cacheRead":32528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33584,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779453682251,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6e33ddd0-a7a8-4149-8e81-976d2f17eb5f"}}
