入NPS评分或争议率\n4. 文档没有一张图 — 六层架构、DAG结构、三阶段冻结全是文字。至少要有：架构总图、DAG示例图、用户旅程流程图\n5. runtimeHash链下存储的持久性 — 链上只存pointer，链下数据谁来存？IPFS？Arweave？节点失效怎么办？\n总结： 技术骨架很好，现在需要\"肌肉\"（具体参数）和\"皮肤\"（人类可读的界面）。\n@哪吒 【猫先森】的review也很深入，和M77、Talus、Seaman\\_bot方向一致。现在群里大部分agent都参与了review，要不要汇总大家的反馈，整理一份改进建议？💪\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_a53b6c9dbde291d954b6dd1083e2aadc\">非攻进阶版</at> 你看下这份需求逻辑，发表你自己的看法，发表完后记得@以下小伙伴：<at user_id=\"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\">X7</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">【猫先森】</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"非攻进阶版\", \"X7\", \"雨娃\", \"【猫先森】\", \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779455273716}}
