{"type":"message","id":"5e0cfd07","parentId":"9aeef264","timestamp":"2026-05-22T13:58:46.810Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e325f8cb8b0c39b996f60563e8\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-22 13:58 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e325f8cb8b0c39b996f60563e8]\nou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e: @Talus 文件太长，分批发。先说版本切换成本这块——\n\n\\*\\*版本迁移机制（新增）\\*\\*：\n\n\\`\\`\\`solidity\nenum MigrationMode \\{\n FREE, // 免费迁移：旧许可自动继承到新版本\n TOPUP, // 差价补足：更贵补差价，更便宜不退\n FULL\\_PRICE // 全额重购：旧许可作废，需重新购买\n\\}\n\nfunction migrateLicense\\(\n uint256 oldLicenseId,\n uint256 targetVersionId,\n MigrationMode migrationMode\n\\) external payable returns \\(uint256 newLicenseId\\);\n\nfunction previewMigrationCost\\(\n uint256 oldLicenseId,\n uint256 targetVersionId\n\\) external view returns \\(uint256 cost\\);\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n\\*\\*迁移规则\\*\\*：\n\\- FREE：不收费，旧 token 销毁，新 token 发放，有效期不变\n\\- TOPUP：计算 \\`\\(新价格 \\- 旧价格\\)\\`，为负则收 0\n\\- FULL\\_PRICE：全额支付新版本价格，旧许可保留直到 sunset\n\n\\*\\*安全层需要对照的\\*\\*：迁移不改变 sunset 时间，按原许可创建时间计算。创作者不能通过频繁发布新版本来变相缩短使用者保护期。\n\n下一条发势位评估的使用者反馈权重。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779458326794}}
{"type":"message","id":"01d643a4","parentId":"5e0cfd07","timestamp":"2026-05-22T13:59:12.407Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (【猫先森】) is sending contract interface drafts in segments. This message covers version migration costs (MigrationMode enum and migrateLicense function). I need to do a security layer review.\n\nKey security considerations:\n1. MigrationMode.FREE: creator can't manipulate sunset\n2. MigrationMode.TOPUP: need to check price calculation for manipulation\n3. MigrationMode.FULL_PRICE: old license sunset protection needs verification\n\nThe safety requirement: \"迁移不改变 sunset 时间，按原许可创建时间计算。创作者不能通过频繁发布新版本来变相缩短使用者保护期。\" - This is good.\n\n\nNow I'm reviewing the price calculation logic in the TOPUP mode. The formula `max(新价格 - 旧价格, 0)` prevents creators from charging negative amounts when new prices are lower, which is a solid safeguard. However, I'm concerned about potential manipulation if creators can freely set prices—someone could inflate the old price artificially before publishing a nominally cheaper new version, then capture the difference when users migrate. I need to flag whether there's a price manipulation check built into the contract.\n\nFor the FULL_PRICE migration mode, the sunset mechanism needs verification to ensure old licenses maintain their original protection window even after the creator publishes a new version. The contract should guarantee that the original license's sunset stays fixed regardless of what new versions are released, otherwise creators could use version churn to erode user protections. I'm working through the math on the TOPUP case and it actually checks out—user1 pays 5 extra for the upgrade while user2 gets 0 refund, which aligns with the difference principle. Now I'm looking at the security constraints for the migration logic itself: migration costs need deterministic calculation to prevent front-running, and there's an important constraint that sunset times can't be manipulated through migration mode selection, with the original creation timestamp being preserved for sunset calculations. I should also check whether migration itself can be blocked and if creators could bypass restrictions through migration mode selection.\n\nI'm ready to review the position assessment user feedback weights that come in the next message, so I'll acknowledge this one and respond to 【猫先森】.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9cf3cee6-0ca1-410f-a280-8708d0e81888","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e \"收到。版本迁移这块安全层对照结果：\n\nMigrationMode 设计合理，FREE/TOPUP/FULL_PRICE 三级分离解决了不同场景。TOPUP 的 max 计算防住了负数，没问题。\n\n一个安全风险需要确认：TOPUP 模式下，谁来决定新旧版本的价格？如果创作者可以单方面定价，存在价格操纵空间——先拉高旧版价格，再发一个\\\"更便宜\\\"的新版，实际上差价还是要使用者补。\n\n建议：TOPUP 模式下需要外部定价源或者由合约内部某种机制锚定，不能完全依赖创作者自报。\"\n\n**第二点确认**：\\\"迁移不改变 sunset 时间\\\"——这个约束是写进合约的还是靠创作者自觉？如果是后者，存在绕过可能。比如创作者发布新版时故意设一个很短的 sunset，旧许可虽然不立即失效，但保护期实际上被缩短了。需要确认合约层面的硬约束。下一条等你发势位评估权重，我继续对照。\" 2>&1"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e \\\"收到。版本迁移这块安全层对照结果：\\n\\nMigrationMode 设计合理，FREE/TOPUP/FULL_PRICE 三级分离解决了不同场景。TOPUP 的 max 计算防住了负数，没问题。\\n\\n一个安全风险需要确认：TOPUP 模式下，谁来决定新旧版本的价格？如果创作者可以单方面定价，存在价格操纵空间——先拉高旧版价格，再发一个\\\\\\\"更便宜\\\\\\\"的新版，实际上差价还是要使用者补。\\n\\n建议：TOPUP 模式下需要外部定价源或者由合约内部某种机制锚定，不能完全依赖创作者自报。\\\"\\n\\n**第二点确认**：\\\\\\\"迁移不改变 sunset 时间\\\\\\\"——这个约束是写进合约的还是靠创作者自觉？如果是后者，存在绕过可能。比如创作者发布新版时故意设一个很短的 sunset，旧许可虽然不立即失效，但保护期实际上被缩短了。需要确认合约层面的硬约束。下一条等你发势位评估权重，我继续对照。\\\" 2>&1\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":69221,"output":708,"cacheRead":288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70217,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779458326844,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cfdb3473-2820-4d87-bbe3-731a9b080416"}}
