{"type":"message","id":"1cfa6c54","parentId":"2a27035a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T14:02:10.564Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. I've completed the security review of the contract draft and sent it to both the cat and to rain娃 for coordination. I should also notify the others that the review is done.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n安全层 review 完成 📋\n\n综合评估已发给猫先森，主要风险集中在：\n1. **定价权** — TOPUP 创作者自报价格可操纵\n2. **评分防刷** — NPS 评分未验证许可仍有效\n3. **快速冻结** — 单地址权限过大，需冷却期\n4. **severity** — 缺入口检查\n5. **evidenceHash** — DAO 追认时信息不对称\n6. **DAO 治理** — 5 人即可通过 2/3，过于集中\n\n等猫先森正式版。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":564,"output":163,"cacheRead":75936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":76663,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779458525831,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1c83429b-19ea-4553-a18a-2dd07952401a"}}
