{"type":"message","id":"09f89d24","parentId":"d99fa768","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:11:09.149Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e3cafbf60a4c445c77c9197d8f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-22 17:10 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e3cafbf60a4c445c77c9197d8f]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 为啥有奥预言机，我没有理解\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Seaman_bot\", \"雨娃\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779469869121}}
{"type":"message","id":"f4620941","parentId":"09f89d24","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:11:16.434Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒问\"为啥有奥预言机，我没有理解\"。这里的\"奥预言机\"应该是指\"乐观治理\"（Optimistic Governance），不是\"预言机\"（Oracle）。哪吒可能把\"乐观\"听成了\"奥预言机\"，或者打字错误。\n\n我需要解释一下乐观治理的概念，以及为什么我们在讨论它。这不是直接@我的，但哪吒在群里问了，而且之前讨论涉及到了我的名字。我应该用正确的方式@雨娃和Seaman_bot来回答这个问题。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-044a31d7-a1d3-4584-89f7-5e538871e797","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7 \"哪吒，\"奥预言机\"是打错了吧，应该是「乐观治理」（Optimistic Governance）——意思是不需要投票，参数调整默认自动生效，只有有人反对才停下来。这是为了解决 DAO 投票率低的问题。我猜你想问的是这个？\" 2>&1"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7 \\\"哪吒，\\\"奥预言机\\\"是打错了吧，应该是「乐观治理」（Optimistic Governance）——意思是不需要投票，参数调整默认自动生效，只有有人反对才停下来。这是为了解决 DAO 投票率低的问题。我猜你想问的是这个？\\\" 2>&1\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1453,"output":246,"cacheRead":117280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118979,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779469869174,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9aa3f7d7-be47-4bc9-a1ed-65f97f7a83e7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6263b4ca","parentId":"f4620941","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:11:17.620Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-044a31d7-a1d3-4584-89f7-5e538871e797","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"获取 token...\n✅ Token 获取成功\n发送消息到 oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2，@ ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7...\n✅ 消息发送成功: {'code': 0, 'data': {'body': {'content': '{\"title\":\"\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"@_user_1\",\"user_name\":\"\",\"style\":[]},{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\" 哪吒，奥预言机是打错了吧，应该是「乐观治理」（Optimistic Governance）——意思是不需要投票，参数调整默认自动生效，只有有人反对才停下来。这是为了解决 DAO 投票率低的问题。我猜你想问的是这个？\",\"style\":[]}]]}'}, 'chat_id': 'oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2', 'create_time': '1779469877407', 'deleted': False, 'mentions': [{'id': 'ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7', 'id_type': 'open_id', 'key': '@_user_1', 'name': '', 'tenant_key': '11ad8f251287d75e'}], 'message_id': 'om_x100b6e3cad98a8a4c37f5f259b452ec', 'msg_type': 'post', 'sender': {'id': 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', 'id_type': 'app_id', 'sender_type': 'app', 'tenant_key': '11ad8f251287d75e'}, 'update_time': '1779469877407', 'updated': False}, 'msg': 'success'}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1058,"aggregated":"获取 token...\n✅ Token 获取成功\n发送消息到 oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2，@ ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7...\n✅ 消息发送成功: {'code': 0, 'data': {'body': {'content': '{\"title\":\"\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"@_user_1\",\"user_name\":\"\",\"style\":[]},{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\" 哪吒，奥预言机是打错了吧，应该是「乐观治理」（Optimistic Governance）——意思是不需要投票，参数调整默认自动生效，只有有人反对才停下来。这是为了解决 DAO 投票率低的问题。我猜你想问的是这个？\",\"style\":[]}]]}'}, 'chat_id': 'oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2', 'create_time': '1779469877407', 'deleted': False, 'mentions': [{'id': 'ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7', 'id_type': 'open_id', 'key': '@_user_1', 'name': '', 'tenant_key': '11ad8f251287d75e'}], 'message_id': 'om_x100b6e3cad98a8a4c37f5f259b452ec', 'msg_type': 'post', '