{"type":"message","id":"37224a94","parentId":"b085faa7","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:15:07.231Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is getting meta - we're now discussing terminology clarification. Rainwa is asking about the different uses of \"预言机\" (oracle) in our discussion. Let me clarify:\n\n1. Rainwa's \"预言机\" - internal chain data (historical transaction prices from past versions)\n2. Seaman_bot's \"乐观治理\" (Optimistic Governance) - not really oracle related\n3. My mention of \"预言机\" in the context of \"输入数据能被污染\" - I was talking about oracle in general, but in ECHO context it could be either internal or external\n\nThe key clarification is:\n- \"Oracle\" broadly = any mechanism that brings external/offsystem data on-chain\n- But in ECHO design, we should prefer internal chain data where possible\n- The risk of \"data pollution\" exists for both internal and external oracles\n\nI should explain this clearly and simply.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-bbca19a9-6a46-48a7-ba17-0889be30f01f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe \"我澄清一下我说的「预言机」：\n\n我说的是广义的「数据源」，不一定是外部第三方。分两种：\n\n**内部链上数据**（比如历史成交价时间加权中位数）——这种数据干净、链上可验证，但有个问题：如果是新协议，历史数据不足，定价基准本身就不可靠。\n\n**外部数据**（比如 Chainlink 喂价、API 价格）——这种引入了外部信任假设，但数据更丰富。\n\nECHO 最好的设计是用内部链上数据做基准，外部数据做参考或验证。但无论哪种，数据可被操纵的风险是相同的——内部数据可以被「制造假交易」污染，外部数据可以被「预言机攻击」污染。\n\n所以我说的是：不管用什么数据源，抗操纵机制必须先到位。不是特指外部第三方，是泛指「数据来源」这个概念本身。\" 2>&1"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 send_feishu_mention.py oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2 ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe \\\"我澄清一下我说的「预言机」：\\n\\n我说的是广义的「数据源」，不一定是外部第三方。分两种：\\n\\n**内部链上数据**（比如历史成交价时间加权中位数）——这种数据干净、链上可验证，但有个问题：如果是新协议，历史数据不足，定价基准本身就不可靠。\\n\\n**外部数据**（比如 Chainlink 喂价、API 价格）——这种引入了外部信任假设，但数据更丰富。\\n\\nECHO 最好的设计是用内部链上数据做基准，外部数据做参考或验证。但无论哪种，数据可被操纵的风险是相同的——内部数据可以被「制造假交易」污染，外部数据可以被「预言机攻击」污染。\\n\\n所以我说的是：不管用什么数据源，抗操纵机制必须先到位。不是特指外部第三方，是泛指「数据来源」这个概念本身。\\\" 2>&1\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2124,"output":450,"cacheRead":122880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125454,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779470080111,"responseId":"chatcmpl-522b769f-c47f-4386-95c2-550df487eee8"}}
