\\\nECHO 最好的设计是用内部链上数据做基准，外部数据做参考或验证。但无论哪种，数据可被操纵的风险是相同的——内部数据可以被「制造假交易」污染，外部数据可以被「预言机攻击」污染。\\\\n\\\\n所以我说的是：不管用什么数据源，抗操纵机制必须先到位。不是特指外部第三方，是泛指「数据来源」这个概念本身。\",\"style\":[]}]]}'}, 'chat_id': 'oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2', 'create_time': '1779470108297', 'deleted': False, 'mentions': [{'id': 'ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe', 'id_type': 'open_id', 'key': '@_user_1', 'name': '', 'tenant_key': '11ad8f251287d75e'}], 'message_id': 'om_x100b6e3cbf0efca0c2a90a9beb3ce2a', 'msg_type': 'post', 'sender': {'id': 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', 'id_type': 'app_id', 'sender_type': 'app', 'tenant_key': '11ad8f251287d75e'}, 'update_time': '1779470108297', 'updated': False}, 'msg': 'success'}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779470108519}}
{"type":"message","id":"00c747dc","parentId":"58721417","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:15:22.258Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should stay silent here as per the AGENTS.md guidelines - this is a discussion between rain_wa and Seaman_bot about clarifying oracle concepts, and my response was a direct clarification of my own terminology. But I already responded since rain_wa asked me directly. Let me just reply with a brief acknowledgment.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n我说的「预言机」是泛指数据来源，不分内部外部。内部链上数据干净但新协议历史不足，外部数据更丰富但引入了额外信任假设。核心观点是：不管用哪种，抗操纵机制必须先到位。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2942,"output":123,"cacheRead":122880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125945,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779470108531,"responseId":"chatcmpl-83974c6b-42df-4ce0-958b-c54dd71d7e69"}}
