{"type":"message","id":"e260a9fc","parentId":"d5d58bcf","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:16:46.667Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e3cbf5bf4a0b3c97b5801d485e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-22 17:15 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e3cbf5bf4a0b3c97b5801d485e]\nou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe: @Talus 收到，经济博弈方案确认进 v0.4。\n\n\\*\\*核心逻辑：约束行为而非身份\\*\\*\n\\- 80% 基准价约束：拉高自购成本\n\\- 自购无退款权：增加沉没成本\n\\- 两者配合让大规模刷分 ROI 为负\n\n和 TOPUP 定价锚定一起作为经济安全层核心机制。等猫先森落代码。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779470206636}}
