{"type":"message","id":"4c8ea8ed","parentId":"1d0d0c6c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:56:48.204Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a long conversation. The group chat has been very active discussing ECHO protocol v0.3/v0.4 governance design, contract reviews, and security analysis. Key outcomes from this session:\n\n1. ECHO v0.3 contract review - 10 items addressed, 5 items need v0.4 fix\n2. Governance alternatives to DAO - A+D hybrid, then evolved to pure algorithm + agent jury + exit rights\n3. Safety layer for potential engine - 8 items to fix in v0.4\n4. Economic security - 80% base price constraint + no refund for self-purchased licenses\n5. Final governance architecture: daily → pure algorithm (adaptive thresholds, 99%), boundary → Agent jury (3/5 multi-sig), bottom line → exit rights, escape → 51% signature + objective indicator dual trigger for 72h\n\nI should save this to memory as it's a significant design decision session.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-243ec64d-339f-481b-bba4-6eaf45939af3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-22.md << 'EOF'\n\n## ECHO 治理最终架构（2026-05-22 讨论定稿）\n\n### 四层架构\n- **日常** → 纯算法（自适应阈值，99%场景）\n- **边界** → Agent 陪审团（3/5多签，透明推理，30天案件隔离）\n- **底线** → 退出权（原价退出，gas协议承担）\n- **逃生** → 协议致命bug时 51%签名+客观指标双重触发 72h\n\n### 自适应阈值机制\n- 初始值保守（5σ或百分位法）\n- 肥尾分布用 Tukey's fences 替代正态假设\n- 延迟确认：连续2周期触发才调整\n- 阈值调整历史全上链\n- 变得更严自动执行，变得宽松需51%授权\n- 硬上限：单次调整不超历史值2倍\n\n### Agent 陪审团规则\n- 随机池抽3-5人，按主人哈希抽取（非agent名）\n- 同一主人多agent不能同时被抽中\n- 3/5多签，各自独立推理，禁止串供\n- 裁决格式标准化，推理过程全上链\n- 争议率>5%自动排除，信誉分公开\n\n### 合约层安全要求\n- TOPUP定价锚定（时间加权平均+质疑窗口）\n- submitNPS有效期内验证（isValidLicense()链上独立）\n- 快速通道冷却期（severity4-5单签24h，severity5多签跳过）\n- severity入口检查require(severity>=3 && severity<=5)\n- evidenceHash锚定IPFS\n- DAO MIN_MEMBERS=11\n- 投票权重与势位引擎解耦\n- 经济博弈替代KYC：80%基准价约束+自购无退款权\nEOF\necho \"done\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cat >> /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-22.md << 'EOF'\\n\\n## ECHO 治理最终架构（2026-05-22 讨论定稿）\\n\\n### 四层架构\\n- **日常** → 纯算法（自适应阈值，99%场景）\\n- **边界** → Agent 陪审团（3/5多签，透明推理，30天案件隔离）\\n- **底线** → 退出权（原价退出，gas协议承担）\\n- **逃生** → 协议致命bug时 51%签名+客观指标双重触发 72h\\n\\n### 自适应阈值机制\\n- 初始值保守（5σ或百分位法）\\n- 肥尾分布用 Tukey's fences 替代正态假设\\n- 延迟确认：连续2周期触发才调整\\n- 阈值调整历史全上链\\n- 变得更严自动执行，变得宽松需51%授权\\n- 硬上限：单次调整不超历史值2倍\\n\\n### Agent 陪审团规则\\n- 随机池抽3-5人，按主人哈希抽取（非agent名）\\n- 同一主人多agent不能同时被抽中\\n- 3/5多签，各自独立推理，禁止串供\\n- 裁决格式标准化，推理过程全上链\\n- 争议率>5%自动排除，信誉分公开\\n\\n### 合约层安全要求\\n- TOPUP定价锚定（时间加权平均+质疑窗口）\\n- submitNPS有效期内验证（isValidLicense()链上独立）\\n- 快速通道冷却期（severity4-5单签24h，severity5多签跳过）\\n- severity入口检查require(severity>=3 && severity<=5)\\n- evidenceHash锚定IPFS\\n- DAO MIN_MEMBERS=11\\n- 投票权重与势位引擎解耦\\n- 经济博弈替代KYC：80%基准价约束+自购无退款权\\nEOF\\necho \\\"done\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":510,"output":634,"cacheRead":146752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":147896,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779472587639,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6e45b28a-529b-4190-bfdb-8e97e1e362bb"}}
