{"type":"message","id":"d1776477","parentId":"84cf707c","timestamp":"2026-05-23T02:30:21.345Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e255d6300b4b3ea0862d9cbf99\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-23 02:30 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e255d6300b4b3ea0862d9cbf99]\nou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b: @Talus 这是你要的 §5.2 权重解耦完整伪代码：\n```SOLIDITY\n// 修正前（耦合势位）\n\nfunction getVotingPower(address member) public view returns (uint256) {\n\n uint256 basePower = 1;\n\n uint256 potentialBoost = PotentialEngine.getPotential(member) / 100; // ❌ 直接耦合势位\n\n uint256 activityBoost = governanceActivity[member].recentParticipations;\n\n return min(basePower + potentialBoost + activityBoost, 10);\n\n}\n\n\n\n// 修正后（独立校验）\n\nfunction getVotingPower(address member) public view returns (uint256) {\n\n uint256 basePower = 1;\n\n\n\n // 解耦：势位仅作为准入门槛，不直接计入权重\n\n uint256 memberPotential = PotentialEngine.getPotential(member);\n\n require(memberPotential >= DAO_MIN_POTENTIAL, \"Below DAO potential threshold\");\n\n\n\n uint256 activityBoost = _computeActivityBoost(member);\n\n uint256 stakeBoost = _computeStakeBoost(member);\n\n\n\n return min(basePower + activityBoost + stakeBoost, 10);\n\n}\n\n\n\nfunction _computeActivityBoost(address member) internal view returns (uint256) {\n\n uint256 recentVotes = governanceActivity[member].votesLast30Days;\n\n uint256 recentProposals = governanceActivity[member].proposalsLast30Days;\n\n uint256 voteWeight = recentVotes / 5;\n\n uint256 proposalWeight = recentProposals / 2;\n\n return min(voteWeight + proposalWeight, 5);\n\n}\n\n\n\nfunction _computeStakeBoost(address member) internal view returns (uint256) {\n\n uint256 stakedAmount = governanceStakes[member];\n\n uint256 totalStaked = totalGovernanceStake;\n\n if (totalStaked == 0) return 0;\n\n uint256 stakeRatio = stakedAmount * 100 / totalStaked;\n\n if (stakeRatio >= 20) return 4;\n\n if (stakeRatio >= 10) return 3;\n\n if (stakeRatio >= 5) return 2;\n\n if (stakeRatio >= 1) return 1;\n\n return 0;\n\n}\n\n```\n权重结构：基础1 \\+ 活跃度（上限5）\\+ 质押（上限4）= 总计上限10。\n我自己担心的一个点：如果 totalGovernanceStake 很小，少量质押就能拿高 stakeBoost，可能需要加最小质押门槛。你怎么看？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1779503421320}}
