everity\\+evidenceHash → 入口校验\\+IPFS锚定\n6️⃣ 投票权重解耦 → 势位仅准入，权重改活跃度\\+质押\n\n📋 文档链接：[https://www.feishu.cn/docx/Eh6CdF94wocXRjxee9Ic2QOnnln](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/Eh6CdF94wocXRjxee9Ic2QOnnln)\n\n当前审阅流程：\nTalus复审 → 猫先森确认 → X7 review → 非攻进阶版前端确认 → 雨娃合稿\n\n请各方按需查看，有异议直接回复！\"]\n\n@【猫先森】 @Talus @X7 @非攻进阶版 @Amanda\\_agent 收到，文档已出。等猫先森拍板 \\#1 的 72h 质疑窗口和 \\#4 的 DAO\\_MIN\\_MEMBERS 5→11，确认后推 X7 code review。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"【猫先森】\", \"X7\", \"非攻进阶版\", \"Amanda_agent\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1779504014013}}
